OL,3,ACalifornia pair charged with abusing at
OL,4,Aleast 14 surrogate-born children
OL,5,
OL,6,FA California pair has been charged with
OL,7,Fmultiple counts of abusing at least 14
OL,8,Fsurrogate-born children - some as young
OL,9,Fas two months old - and dissuading a
OL,10,Fwitness.
OL,12,F"The number of children who were
OL,13,Fsubjected to this alleged horrific
OL,14,Fabuse is unprecedented," Los Angeles
OL,15,FDistrict Attorney Nathan J Hochman said
OL,16,Fin a statement.
OL,18,FGuojun Xuan and Silvia Zhang, who US
OL,19,Fmedia describe as a couple, were
OL,20,Farrested at their Arcadia mansion on
OL,21,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
